{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Surely YHWH is in this place.</b> There is no doubt that this place is prepared for prophecy, since I saw in it such a vision without my intending toward prophecy. For indeed the dispositions of the faculties of the intellectual essence of the prophet change according to the variation of the earth and the air, as they said (Bava Batra 158b): the air of the Land of Israel makes one wise." "<b>And I did not know.</b> For had I known, I would have prepared myself for prophecy — but so I did not do."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:32:11.556028542Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}